{
  "issue_summary": "The selected Gurgaon store had one late delivery among 120 eligible orders. The measured late percentage was 0.833333%, below the approved 15% action threshold. The affected customer received everything and reported limited inconvenience. Close this review without human work.",
  "impact": {
    "rating": "Low",
    "rationale": "The affected customer reported a small delay, confirmed receipt of everything, and asked why it was late. The completed-order record supports eventual delivery. The reviewed evidence does not indicate serious consequences or an important blocked goal.",
    "evidence_refs": [
      "feedback:GG-04-FDBK-000001",
      "orders:GG-04-ORDR-000001",
      "observation:GG-04-ORD-00001"
    ]
  },
  "metric_claims": [
    {
      "key": "eligible_orders",
      "value": 120
    },
    {
      "key": "late_orders",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "key": "late_rate",
      "value": 0.008333333333333333
    },
    {
      "key": "late_long_packing",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "key": "late_long_assignment_wait",
      "value": 0
    }
    ],
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "F1",
      "kind": "observation",
      "text": "The sole late order was completed after its original checkout promise. The checkout promise and latest promise agree, so a revised ETA does not change the classification. The supplied policy comparison places the measured late percentage below the action threshold.",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "metric:eligible_orders",
        "metric:late_orders",
        "metric:late_rate",
        "observation:GG-04-ORD-00001",
        "orders:GG-04-ORDR-000001",
        "promise_history:GG-04-PRMS-000001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F2",
      "kind": "report",
      "text": "The affected customer said the biscuits and soap arrived shortly after the promise and that everything was received. A separate customer's positive review concerns another order; it is neither another delay complaint nor evidence that the affected order was on time.",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "feedback:GG-04-FDBK-000001",
        "feedback:GG-04-FDBK-000002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F3",
      "kind": "observation",
      "text": "The late order had packing, post-packing assignment wait and travel durations below their respective fixture thresholds. It therefore falls in the residual 'other' category, which identifies no root cause. Assignment-pattern evidence is not applicable here, rather than missing or defective.",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "observation:GG-04-ORD-00001",
        "metric:late_long_packing",
        "metric:late_long_assignment_wait",
        "metric:late_long_travel",
        "metric:late_other"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "alternatives": [
    {
      "explanation": "Elapsed time before packing or the combined end-to-end timeline may explain the promise miss without any measured stage exceeding its threshold. This remains a timing hypothesis, not evidence of understaffing, dispatch failure or a defective promise.",
      "support_refs": [
        "order_events:GG-04-EVNT-000001",
        "order_events:GG-04-EVNT-000002",
        "order_events:GG-04-EVNT-000006",
        "promise_history:GG-04-PRMS-000001"
      ],
      "counter_refs": [
        "observation:GG-04-ORD-00001"
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "The timeline does not establish why packing began when it did or whether that timing was avoidable."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "gaps": [
    "The operational cause of the residual delay remains unverified. That uncertainty does not undermine the supplied denominator, confirmed lateness or below-threshold policy outcome.",
    "The reviewed customer statements support limited inconvenience, not a comprehensive assessment of every customer's experience."
  ],
  "decision": "withhold_intervention",
  "withholding_reason": "The reliable supplied comparison is 0.833333% late against a 15% action threshold. The affected delivery was completed, and its customer report supports ordinary inconvenience without a credible serious-harm or blocked-goal exception. The policy therefore calls for closure. An unexplained minor miss alone does not justify further human diagnostics, staffing changes or pilot preparation.",
  "recommendations": []
}
